# Mega Crit's code, not ours to redistribute. Both are reference material a
# developer supplies locally: sts2-decompiled/ to read, lib/ to compile against.
# DataExporter.csproj excludes them from the build, since the SDK globs **/*.cs
# and would otherwise compile the whole decompiled game into the mod.
sts2-decompiled/
lib/